    "id": "hurufi.production.literacy.wave16",
    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 16",
    "description": "Sixteenth production literacy slice: kasra-closed CLASS transfer onto ba, genuine first final ـت, then decode bint. Compact two-unit wave. No new phonics rule, no new consonant, no scored bin.closed, no damma, madd-yaa, madd-waw, hamza, sentences, or Wave 17.",
    "notProductionCurriculum": false
  },
